+//
+// Dragon Fury (2026-10-30): one member per interpolator, as XenosRecomp declares the vertex shader's outputs (six
+// colours: mgr-nx-deko passes COLOR2..5 too). The arrays (texcoord[16], color[2]) put the normals, tangent and point
+// data at other locations than the vertex and pixel shaders, and on the Adreno 650's driver every rectangle came out
+// with the wrong texture coordinates (the Budokai's full-screen FXAA pass: the frame zoomed and cut on the diagonal).
+struct Vertex
